  "body": "Positioned in a quiet, family-friendly location and backing directly onto a park ,  this well-presented three-bedroom, one-bathroom home offers an outstanding opportunity for first-home buyers, young families, or savvy investors looking to secure a property in the ever-popular Stanmore Bay.\r\n\r\nDesigned for relaxed, low-maintenance living, the home features gas hot water , a double carport, a spacious covered deck that's perfect for year-round entertaining, and a large dry storage area beneath the house, ideal for bikes, tools, outdoor equipment, or a workshop. The easy-care section means you'll spend less time on maintenance and more time enjoying the lifestyle this location has to offer.\r\n\r\nConveniently located close to beautiful beaches, local shops, cafés, public transport, and within sought-after school zones, this property combines lifestyle and practicality in one of the Hibiscus Coast's most desirable locations.\r\n\r\nWhether you're taking your first step onto the property ladder, downsizing to an easy-care home, or adding to your investment portfolio, this is an opportunity not to be missed.\r\n\r\nYour next chapter starts here - come and see everything this fantastic Stanmore Bay home has to offer.\r\n\r\nSee interactive features for this property on barfoot.co.nz. Click the \"View office website\" link at the bottom of this page.",
